VALUES ('2026-W27', NULL, 'S1 "Rotation broadens; soft data builds the cut case; oil stays low" (40%)', 'Materialized', '[{"grade":"Partial","id":"S2","probability":35,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"},{"grade":"Not","id":"S3","probability":25,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"}]'::jsonb, 'valid - Phase 3 rotation continued, Dow record on broad breadth', 'valid but turning - Phase 4 down-leg, then the first 4→5 tell (ETF streak snapped, BTC +6%)', 'Gated the bullish index call on chips "basing" - they kept bleeding and the index rose anyway; and over-extrapolated the 3-week BTC ETF outflow streak into a regime right as it inflected. Both = over-anchoring a trend at its inflection.', NULL, NULL, NULL, false, NULL)
