VALUES ('2026-W28', NULL, 'S1 "Disinflation confirms; rotation broadens; benign grind up" (45%)', 'Partial', '[{"grade":"Not","id":"S2","probability":35,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"},{"grade":"Not","id":"S3","probability":20,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"}]'::jsonb, 'valid - Phase 3 held, leadership re-narrowed to Mag 7 at the record', 'valid and advancing - Phase 4 held, 4→5 tracker to 2/4 (first positive flow week, F&G crossed 25)', 'Targets hit via the wrong mechanism: priced "rotation broadens" and got a Mag-7 re-rate while the value rotation stalled - leadership regimes flip faster than phase calls, so stop coupling index direction to a specific leadership continuing; and Iran whipsawed a 5th time (ceasefire collapsed, oil +4-5%).', NULL, NULL, NULL, false, NULL)
