VALUES ('2026-W29', NULL, 'S2 "In-line 0.3% CPI: hawkish-hold grind, chop at the record" (40%)', 'Partial', '[{"grade":"Partial","id":"S1","probability":30,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"},{"grade":"Partial","id":"S3","probability":30,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"}]'::jsonb, 'valid - Phase 3 held, distribution matured as the narrow AI leadership cracked while breadth rose', 'advanced - the named falsifier (tested $60K hold + second green flow week) both hit; 4→5 tracker to 3/4, phase upgraded to 5', 'Priced the macro tails two-sided and left leadership one-sided: every downside path was gated on a hot CPI, so the correct macro branch (S1 trigger) and the correct tape (S3 semis de-rate) landed in different scenarios and neither graded clean. Leadership needs its own two-sided scenario axis, not a footnote inside a macro trigger. Also had no slot for a dateless narrative shock (Kimi K3).', NULL, NULL, NULL, false, NULL)
