VALUES ('2026-W30', NULL, 'S2 "Distribution grinds; index chops while semis stay heavy" (40%)', 'Partial', '[{"grade":"Not","id":"S1","probability":30,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"},{"grade":"Partial","id":"S3","probability":30,"source":"Scorecard Ledger"}]'::jsonb, 'valid - Phase 3 held; index −0.61% while two Mag-7 names cascaded, breadth 65.8%, credit +6bp', 'valid - Phase 5 held; floor survived a rates shock, 3rd green ETF week in BTC and ETH', 'Built the oil tail entirely through Hormuz and got hit by the second front (Houthis closing Bab el-Mandeb, removing Saudi''s bypass, $88 → $100 with Hormuz unchanged). Framed the capex swing as revenue-vs-economics when Alphabet re-framed it as free cash flow (capex raised, FCF −$5.9B, −7%). And stated the de-gross trigger as a bare price level, so 7,450 fired at VIX 18.6 and breadth 65.8% - a risk trigger needs a confirming-regime clause.', NULL, NULL, NULL, false, NULL)
