VALUES ('2026-W34', '19373545-4a21-523d-a641-c4f95343fa68', 'S2 "Records hold; reward-per-beat decay spreads; chop under 7,850" (40%)', 'Partial', '[{"grade":"Partial","id":"S1","note":"Its crypto leg (\"$66K weekly close on green flow → $70K\") materialized and overshot to $77K on the year''s biggest inflow week; every equity leg failed — no 7,850, breadth fell, the Russell surrendered its record.","probability":30,"source":"sidecar 2026-W35","targets_hit":null,"targets_n":null,"title":"Hold locked; NVDA delivers; the melt-up broadens"},{"grade":"Partial","id":"S3","note":"The inflation-tail trigger fired exactly as written (economic-isolation measures took Brent over $92) and two asset targets hit (gold >$4,600, 30Y >5.30%), but the confirming risk regime never came: no VIX >18, no HY >285, no breadth <68%.","probability":30,"source":"sidecar 2026-W35","targets_hit":null,"targets_n":null,"title":"The scare lands — growth tips, or oil/inflation re-arms"}]'::jsonb, 'valid - Phase 3 held and finally recovered its internals after a fortnight on the macro layer alone: breadth -3.24 pts, HY and IG both widened, VIX and MOVE lifted off run-lows, and a Walmart beat-and-raise was punished 9%', 'wrong - Phase 5 invalidated on price; the named falsifier (a flow-confirmed reclaim) fired in full at +20% and the 5→1 tracker went 1-of-4 to 4-of-4 in five sessions', 'Bounded Brent at $92 for the second time in a month, and modelled the Iran tail as kinetic when the actual escalation was financial (secondary sanctions on Chinese refiners, routing an oil trade through US-China). Treated equities and crypto as one risk regime with a decoupling footnote when they traded opposite sides of the same variable - long-end yields - so the S&P landed inside its band as the midpoint of a tug-of-war no branch contemplated. And a Lull call has no mechanism for a +20% week: when a phase falsifier is a conjunction (reclaim AND flow), price the case where both arrive at once.', NULL, NULL, NULL, false, TIMESTAMPTZ '2026-08-24T00:00:00Z')
